00:42:46.490 --> 00:42:49.250
And for GCE as a
whole, we kind of

00:42:49.250 --> 00:42:53.400
have an entire Windows
ecosystem offering now,

00:42:53.400 --> 00:42:56.870
which it's a much more complete
story than what was, of course,

00:42:56.870 --> 00:42:58.170
previously available.

00:42:58.170 --> 00:43:02.810
And so whether you're trying
to run Windows Server on GCE,

00:43:02.810 --> 00:43:05.060
whether you're looking
to use our Managed AD

00:43:05.060 --> 00:43:07.580
service and Managed
SQL Server, now you

00:43:07.580 --> 00:43:11.150
don't have to kind of
bit-wise or piecemeal move on

00:43:11.150 --> 00:43:12.500
to the platform.

00:43:12.500 --> 00:43:15.440
We can actually accommodate
your entire ecosystem

00:43:15.440 --> 00:43:17.120
in your entire stack.

